    "accessibility": {
      "short": "A dotted-color painting of people relaxing on a grassy riverbank with trees, boats, umbrellas, a dog, and a monkey.",
      "long": "A horizontally oriented painting rendered entirely in small, discrete colored dots. In the foreground, several figures recline and sit on green grass; one man lies on his back wearing a sleeveless top and cap, another sits upright in a dark suit and top hat holding a cane. A black dog walks toward the center, and near the right edge, a small brown monkey stands on its hind legs beside a woman in a long dark dress and hat holding a black umbrella. Midground features include seated and standing figures under red, blue, and black umbrellas, a child in white, and a woman in a long red dress. Background shows a calm river with sailboats and rowboats, and more distant figures along the far bank beneath leafy green trees. The lighting creates sharp diagonal shadows across the grass.",
      "claimIds": [
